The actual font is in that file "8" (named for its pointsize).  The file
"hack.font" tells the system where to look for different sizes of font
"hack."  Generally, the *.font files appear in fonts: and the fonts they
point to are in subdirectories of fonts: and are named with the font name.
But this doesen't have to be the case and the version of hack.font I have
points to nethack:hack/  So, make a directory "hack" under root of nethack:
and move "8" into it.  I think hack looks for hack.font in both fonts: and
the current dir, so I just left it in the root of nethack:
